			"Message": "docs(Output): Add Mermaid system architecture diagram to README\n\nIntroduce a comprehensive Mermaid graph illustrating the Output build artifact pipeline — from ESBuild compilation targets (Microsoft/VSCode, CEL sources, Rest compiler integration) through the Plugin transform pipeline (Copy, Polyfill, Transform) and Polyfill compatibility shims, to the Service runtime helpers and the three artifact consumers (Sky, Cocoon, Wind).\n\nThe diagram clarifies the dual-compilation strategy (esbuild with Rest/ OXC fallback), plugin ordering, polyfill coverage, and data flow from source dependencies to downstream components. This makes the build system's architecture visually navigable for new contributors and serves as a reference for debugging pipeline issues.",
			"SHA": "9050130a3ec3b265a0e7490218f328b391643314"
